{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1307243","title":"Microbial community in dye wastewater treatment with different cosubstrates","description":"This dataset contains microbial community data obtained from a batch-scale anaerobic system treating the azo dye Reactive Black 5. The experiments were conducted with five different cosubstrates (starch, glucose, ethanol, propionate, and acetate) under two lines of vials (with dye and without dye) and two operational phases (with and without magnetite).To further investigate the long-term microbial community dynamics in ethanol-fed systems, a continuous-scale experiment was carried out for 250 days using ethanol as the primary cosubstrate. Microbial samples were collected from three distinct phases: ethanol only, ethanol with dye, and ethanol with dye supplemented with magnetite.","center":"Kyoto University","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2025/08/18 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN50657276","Metagenome or environmental sample from metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater",null,2023,"JP","Niigata",1856199,"Nagaoka","verified",37.446,138.85,"Japan:Nagaoka","Anaerobic dye wastewater batch reactor with ethanol",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN50657277","Metagenome or environmental sample from metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater",null,2023,"JP","Niigata",1856199,"Nagaoka","verified",37.446,138.85,"Japan:Nagaoka","Anaerobic dye wastewater batch reactor with ethanol and magnetite",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN50657278","Metagenome or environmental sample from metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater",null,2023,"JP","Niigata",1856199,"Nagaok